.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH batten-generate 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-generate \- Emit artifacts derived from the command spec, on stdout
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten generate\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Emit artifacts derived from the command spec, on stdout
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
batten\-generate\-completions(1)
Emit the shell completion script for one shell
.TP
batten\-generate\-man(1)
Emit the roff man page for one command, on stdout
.TP
batten\-generate\-markdown(1)
Emit the whole command surface as one markdown reference, on stdout
.TP
batten\-generate\-schema(1)
Emit the JSON Schema for a config surface, derived from the config types
.TP
batten\-generate\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
